This is how you'd integrate AgentiCuántico from your backend once the API is enabled for your account (illustrative example):

```js
const res = await fetch('https://api.agenticuantico.dev.ar/api/chat', {
  method: 'POST',
  credentials: 'include',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    agent: 'comercial',
    lang: 'en',
    messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Qualify this lead' }]
  })
});
// The answer is streamed (Server-Sent Events)
```

- AI keys live only on the server.
- Answers are streamed.

To enable the API for your company, email agenticuantico@gmail.com with the subject **Consulta Comercial**.
